{title: My Everything}
{artist: Glenn Fredly}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[E]Cruising when the sun goes [F#m]down
[Asus2]Across the sea

Searching for, something inside of me
[E]I would find all the lost [F#m]pieces
[Asus2]Hardly feel, deep and real

I was blinded now I see
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge: Pre-chorus}
[C#m]Hey hey hey [B]you're the one
[Asus2]Hey hey hey you're the one
[C#m]Hey hey hey [B]I can't [Asus2]live without you
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[E]Take me [F#m]to your place[Asus2]
[B]Where our hearts [C#m]belong together
[G#m7]I will follow you
[Asus2]You're the reason that I breathe

[E]I'll come [F#m]running to you[Asus2]
[B]Fill me with [C#m]your love forever
[G#m7]I'll promise you one thing
[Asus2]That I would never let you go
[Am7]'Cause you are my everything
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[E]You're the one, you're my inspiration
[F#m]You're the one, kiss, you're the one
[Asus2]You're the light that would keep me safe and warm
[Asus2]You're the one, kiss, you're the one
[E]Like the sun goes down, coming [F#m]from above all
                    [Asus2]To the deepest ocean and highest mountain
[Asus2]Deep and real deep I can see now
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge: Pre-chorus}
[C#m]Hey hey hey [B]you're the one
[Asus2]Hey hey hey you're the one
[C#m]Hey hey hey [B]I can't [Asus2]live without you
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[E]Take me [F#m]to your place[Asus2]
[B]Where our hearts [C#m]belong together
[G#m7]I will follow you
[Asus2]You're the reason that I breathe

[E]I'll come [F#m]running to you[Asus2]
[B]Fill me with [C#m]your love forever
[G#m7]I'll promise you one thing
[Asus2]That I would never let you go
[Am7]'Cause you are my everything
{end_of_chorus}
